ondition is $0<r\\le 1.$ \n\nTherefore, the sequence converges if \n\n$$\n0<9{x}^{2}\\le 1\\,⟹\\,0<{x}^{2}\\le \\frac{1}{9}.\n$$\n\nTaking into account the fact that $x$ is positive, we get\n\n$$\n0<x\\le \\frac{1}{3}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/state.json" "file_sha256" "1e394b0498f7c0cd247c708f1eb97231f17f2a2ac880e99ea31c626105221cc1"} {"question" "q-351612" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "024681eacd50d272bc000914d0dae0ae76e6f051f0fce1d4415fcab82dd2bdfd"} {"question" "q-351612" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/state.json" "file_sha256" "1e394b0498f7c0cd247c708f1eb97231f17f2a2ac880e99ea31c626105221cc1"} {"question" "q-351612" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/state.json" "file_sha256" "1e394b0498f7c0cd247c708f1eb97231f17f2a2ac880e99ea31c626105221cc1"} {"question" "q-351612" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/state.json" "file_sha256" "1e394b0498f7c0cd247c708f1eb97231f17f2a2ac880e99ea31c626105221cc1"} {"question" "q-351612" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\le"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031858/state.json" "file_sha256" "1e394b0498f7c0cd2